From: Pavle012 <pavle@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 14:26:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Allow Fabric mods on (Neo)Forge instances with Sinytra
 Connector

When Sinytra Connector is installed on a Forge or NeoForge instance, Fabric
mods count as compatible when browsing and installing, as a fallback after
the instance's own loader. The resolver now treats the loader list as an
order of preference, and Fabric API is not added as a dependency (Forgified
Fabric API provides it).
